# Opt-in creds for the live testnet/mirrornet broadcast smoke
# (app/utils/__tests__/testnetBroadcast.smoke.test.ts).
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in. With all three set, the smoke broadcasts a balance-neutral
# custom_json against the node and asserts a real hived accepts it. Absent -> the test stays skipped.
#
# ⚠️ Use a THROWAWAY account. A posting key that works on Mirrornet is the SAME key that works on
#    mainnet for that account's social ops — never put a valuable/real account's key here. A
#    Mirrornet-only account (created there, not on mainnet) is ideal: its key has zero mainnet value.

# Mirrornet mirrors mainnet on a separate chain_id (HIVE/HBD symbols, STM prefix). The smoke reads the
# real chain_id from the node's get_config, so nothing is hardcoded.
VESSEL_TESTNET_NODE=https://api.fake.openhive.network
VESSEL_TESTNET_ACCOUNT=your-throwaway-account
VESSEL_TESTNET_WIF=5Kxxxxxxxx-that-account-POSTING-wif-only
